\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {13}{\ignorespaces \textsc  {DDR}{}$\to $downstream AUC for the graph-reliant backbone GKT, with a positive control. For each dataset the prerequisite graph $\ensuremath  {E_{\text  {pre}}}$ is perturbed by each operator at strength $p$; \emph  {AUC drop} is the mean decrease in test AUC relative to the unperturbed (\textsc  {DDR}{}$=0$) baseline across folds (baselines: XES3G5M $0.8344$, ASSISTments $0.9629$). The bottom block reports the manipulation-check anchors ($p{=}0.90$, near-total graph destruction). On XES3G5M, destroying the graph moves GKT by $0.07$--$0.09$ AUC and \textsc  {DDR}{} tracks the drop almost perfectly (Pearson $r{=}0.97$ over the $p{\le }0.3$ core, $0.99$ including anchors); at matched budget, \texttt  {prereq\_preserve} degrades AUC least and \texttt  {node\_drop} most. On ASSISTments the same total destruction moves GKT by ${\le }0.002$, so this cell (like DGEKT in Table~\ref {tab:ddr-downstream}) is a \emph  {low-reliance anchor} whose correlation is not practically meaningful.}}{29}{table.caption.47}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:ddr-downstream-gkt}{{13}{29}{\DDR {}$\to $downstream AUC for the graph-reliant backbone GKT, with a positive control. For each dataset the prerequisite graph $\Epre $ is perturbed by each operator at strength $p$; \emph {AUC drop} is the mean decrease in test AUC relative to the unperturbed (\DDR {}$=0$) baseline across folds (baselines: XES3G5M $0.8344$, ASSISTments $0.9629$). The bottom block reports the manipulation-check anchors ($p{=}0.90$, near-total graph destruction). On XES3G5M, destroying the graph moves GKT by $0.07$--$0.09$ AUC and \DDR {} tracks the drop almost perfectly (Pearson $r{=}0.97$ over the $p{\le }0.3$ core, $0.99$ including anchors); at matched budget, \texttt {prereq\_preserve} degrades AUC least and \texttt {node\_drop} most. On ASSISTments the same total destruction moves GKT by ${\le }0.002$, so this cell (like DGEKT in Table~\ref {tab:ddr-downstream}) is a \emph {low-reliance anchor} whose correlation is not practically meaningful}{table.caption.47}{}}
\newlabel{tab:ddr-downstream-gkt@cref}{{[table][13][]13}{[1][28][]29}{}{}{}}
